---
// Home 4 Visual Workflow Builder & Automation Engine
---

<section id="workflow" class="py-20 md:py-28 bg-[#0A0B10] border-b border-white/5 text-white relative overflow-hidden">
  
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
    
    <!-- Section Header -->
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center mb-14 sm:mb-18">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-indigo-950/80 border border-indigo-800/60 text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold text-indigo-300 mb-4">
        <span>No-Code Event Automation</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold text-white tracking-tight font-['Plus_Jakarta_Sans'] leading-[1.12]">
        Build complex conversational pipelines <br class="hidden sm:inline" />
        <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-indigo-400 to-purple-300 bg-clip-text text-transparent">with drag-and-drop simplicity.</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-base sm:text-lg text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
        Orchestrate multi-step routing, CRM synchronization, and automated Google review requests in minutes.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Node-Based Visual Pipeline Container -->
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto bg-[#12131F] border border-white/10 rounded-3xl p-8 sm:p-12 shadow-2xl relative">
      
      <!-- Ambient Glow Behind Nodes -->
      <div class="absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-[500px] h-[250px] bg-purple-600/10 rounded-full blur-[100px] pointer-events-none"></div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 relative z-10 items-stretch">
        
        <!-- NODE 1: TRIGGER -->
        <div class="bg-white/[0.04] border border-white/10 hover:border-emerald-500/50 rounded-2xl p-6 transition-all group flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div class="space-y-3">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
              <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-xl bg-emerald-950/80 border border-emerald-500/30 text-emerald-400 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xs font-mono">01</span>
              <span class="text-[10px] uppercase font-mono text-emerald-400 font-bold">Trigger</span>
            </div>
            <h4 class="text-base font-bold text-white">Inbound Lead Detected</h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
              Customer sends a message via WhatsApp Business, Instagram DM, or live webchat widget.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-6 pt-3 border-t border-white/10 font-mono text-[11px] text-emerald-400">
            ✓ Webhook Event Ingested
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- NODE 2: SMART EVALUATION -->
        <div class="bg-white/[0.04] border border-purple-500/40 hover:border-purple-400 rounded-2xl p-6 transition-all group flex flex-col justify-between shadow-[0_0_30px_rgba(124,58,237,0.15)]">
          <div class="space-y-3">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
              <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-xl bg-purple-950/80 border border-purple-500/40 text-purple-300 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xs font-mono">02</span>
              <span class="text-[10px] uppercase font-mono text-purple-300 font-bold">Smart Logic</span>
            </div>
            <h4 class="text-base font-bold text-white">Intent & VIP Routing</h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
              Evaluates deal size, previous order history, keyword intent, and routes to on-duty specialists.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-6 pt-3 border-t border-white/10 font-mono text-[11px] text-purple-300">
            ✓ Context Enriched in 14ms
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- NODE 3: MULTI-ACTION EXECUTION -->
        <div class="bg-white/[0.04] border border-white/10 hover:border-amber-500/50 rounded-2xl p-6 transition-all group flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div class="space-y-3">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
              <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-xl bg-amber-950/80 border border-amber-500/30 text-amber-400 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xs font-mono">03</span>
              <span class="text-[10px] uppercase font-mono text-amber-400 font-bold">Execution</span>
            </div>
            <h4 class="text-base font-bold text-white">Reply & Review Engine</h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
              Sends personalized reply, creates CRM ticket, and triggers post-resolution Google Review campaign.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-6 pt-3 border-t border-white/10 font-mono text-[11px] text-amber-400">
            ✓ 5-Star Review Captured
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>

    </div>

  </div>

</section>
